xternal` as shown in the Remix section."},"22":{"id":"/docs-20","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#other-bundlers","content":"Any bundler that supports CSS imports will work with Antares. If your bundler does not process CSS imports from `node_modules` by default, ensure it is configured to do so. For example, with raw webpack you may need `css-loader` configured to handle `.css` files from `node_modules`."},"23":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"page","content":"Avatar","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar"},"24":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-0","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar","content":"A visual representation of a user or entity, shown as a photo or a monogram of their initials."},"25":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-1","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#features","content":"Features"},"26":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-2","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#installation","content":"Installation"},"27":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-3","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#examples","content":"Examples"},"28":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-4","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#default","content":"Default"},"29":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-5","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#image","content":"Image"},"30":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-6","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#image-fallback","content":"Image Fallback"},"31":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-7","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#shapes-an